The fifth ($\alpha{=}0.45$: $0/8{\to}5/8$) falsified the ceiling model, confirming the blind zone is power-limited; the synchronous dip at $\alpha{=}0.60$ persists ($0/8$; FDR $p{=}0.064$), confirming a structural regime.

